Subject: [PATCH] =?UTF-8?q?[daveey]=20lifecycle=20guard:=20keep=20stdin=20?=
 =?UTF-8?q?feeds=20through=20`2>&1`,=20`>(=E2=80=A6)`,=20bare=20`cat`/`tee?=
